      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Newville’s historic ghost walk draws over 200 visitors each year, while the annual Halloween parade attracts nearly 5,000 people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
